**Known for**: ThePrimeagen Twitch/YouTube accounts

**Alias**: ThePrimeagen 

Popular Twitch streamer and YouTube personality whose content isn't all that
weird, but who is publicly associated with a bunch of weirdos in this list.
He's a speaker at Omacon 2026,
[David Heinemeier Hansson]($link.page('weird-guys').unsafeRef('dhh'))'s
conference for fashy weirdos,[[source]][0] and a donor to
[Andreas Kling]($link.page('weird-guys').unsafeRef('kling'))'s
Ladybird,[[source]][1] and otherwise maintains associations with and
financially supports people in a little network of weirdos.

